Open GPU DB
Copyright 2026 onepunk

This product includes data from the RightNow GPU Database:
https://github.com/RightNow-AI/RightNow-GPU-Database

RightNow GPU Database is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
Its data is sourced from the TechPowerUp GPU Database via dbgpu, as documented
by the RightNow project. The imported snapshot, its exact revision, checksum,
and retrieval date are recorded in data/imports/rightnow/metadata.json.

Open GPU DB adds normalization, stable identifiers, aliases, official
vendor corrections and additions, field-level provenance, validation, and
generated artifacts. See README.md for the layering model.
